{"ayah/44-32.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"de\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir von Ad-Dukhaan 44:32 — nach Ibn Taimiyya und Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Und Wir erwählten sie ja mit Wissen vor den (anderen) Weltenbewohnern\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/44-32.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/44-32.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/44-32.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/44-32.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/44-32.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/44-32.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/44-32.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/44-32.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/44-32.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/44-32.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/44-32.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/44-32.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/44-32.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/44-32.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/44-32.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/44-32.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/44-32.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir von Ad-Dukhaan 44:32 — nach Ibn Taimiyya und Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Und Wir erwählten sie ja mit Wissen vor den (anderen) Weltenbewohnern\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/de/\">Startseite</a> › <a href=\"/de/surah/44.html\">Sura Ad-Dukhaan</a> › Vers 32</nav><h1>Tafsir von Sura Ad-Dukhaan 44:32</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَلَقَدِ اخْتَرْنَاهُمْ عَلَىٰ عِلْمٍ عَلَى الْعَالَمِينَ﴾</p><section><h3>Übersetzung der Bedeutung</h3><p class=\"tr\">Und Wir erwählten sie ja mit Wissen vor den (anderen) Weltenbewohnern</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">German Translation - Frank Bubenheim — v1.1.4 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Die Worte der beiden Imame werden im arabischen Original wortgetreu und mit Quellenangaben wiedergegeben.</p><section><h2>Schaich al-Islam Ibn Taimiyya</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وقد يراد بالعالمين أهل زمن واحد كما في قوله: {اخترناهم على علم على العالمين}<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 4/367</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">والإختيار في لغة القرآن يراد به التفضيل والإنتقاء والإصطفاء<cite>«رسالة في معنى كون الرب عادلا» 1/137</cite></blockquote></section><section><h2>Imam Ibn al-Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">لا خلاف بين الناس أن المعنى على علم منا بأنهم أهل الاختيار فالجملة في موضع نصب على الحال أي اخترناهم عالمين بهم وبأحوالهم<cite>«شفاء العليل في مسائل القضاء والقدر والحكمة والتعليل» 1/32</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=de#s44a32\">Im interaktiven Tafsir öffnen (vollständige Texte)</a><div class=\"pn\"><span></span><a href=\"/de/ayah/44-56.html\">Nächster Vers (44:56)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir der beiden Schaichs · <a href=\"/de/\">Startseite</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Über das Projekt</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Datenschutz &amp; Bedingungen</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","surah/44.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"de\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir von Sura Ad-Dukhaan — nach Ibn Taimiyya und Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Tafsir von Sura Ad-Dukhaan — Die Bedeutungen des Korans in den Worten von Ibn Taimiyya und Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/surah/44.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/surah/44.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/surah/44.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/surah/44.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/surah/44.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/surah/44.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/surah/44.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/surah/44.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/surah/44.html\">\n<link rel